{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/WOD.png?t=1745495790\" /><br><strong>Your final ride begins here - a place where you'll question your sanity while reality distorts into an endless nightmare.</strong>\u00a0<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Bunker.gif?t=1745495790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But it's not all so bad, it's about having fun too, right? Because you can interact with some of the forgotten attractions in the park. They still work, altough no one knows why...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Carousel.gif?t=1745495790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find out why are you here and what happened in this place. But do you really want to know?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Lion.gif?t=1745495790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You keep hearing things, but that has to be your mind playing tricks, because you are all alone...or are you?</strong>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570000?t=1745495790","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/ac9e2a62e725372158a0e20dfe40583b68c548e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745495790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/9d44699de040c8406d7f6d85d29d0bbb38c12fb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745495790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/9d44699de0